#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi paket\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami menyarankan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"The examples in this section illustrate some common ways to use Estimator. Before running these examples, follow the instructions in [Install Qiskit.](install-qiskit)\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Contoh-contoh di bagian ini mengilustrasikan beberapa cara umum menggunakan Estimator. Sebelum menjalankan contoh-contoh ini, ikuti petunjuk di [Instal Qiskit.](install-qiskit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"These examples all use the primitives from Qiskit Runtime, but you could use the base primitives instead.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Semua contoh ini menggunakan primitif dari Qiskit Runtime, tetapi kamu bisa menggunakan primitif dasar sebagai gantinya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Efficiently calculate and interpret expectation values of the quantum "
"operators required for many algorithms with Estimator. Explore uses in "
"molecular modeling, machine learning, and complex optimization problems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hitung dan interpretasikan nilai ekspektasi dari operator kuantum yang "
"diperlukan untuk banyak algoritma secara efisien dengan Estimator. Jelajahi "
"penggunaannya dalam pemodelan molekuler, machine learning, dan masalah "
"optimasi kompleks.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run a single experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"
msgstr "Jalankan satu eksperimen {#run-a-single-experiment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Estimator to determine the expectation value of a single circuit-"
"observable pair.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Estimator untuk menentukan nilai ekspektasi dari sepasang circuit-"
"observable tunggal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run multiple experiments in a single job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-"
"single-job}"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan beberapa eksperimen dalam satu job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-"
"single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Estimator to determine the expectation values of multiple circuit-"
"observable pairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Estimator untuk menentukan nilai ekspektasi dari beberapa pasangan "
"circuit-observable.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run parameterized circuits {#run-parameterized-circuits}"
msgstr "Jalankan circuit berparameter {#run-parameterized-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Estimator to run three experiments in a single job, leveraging parameter"
" values to increase circuit reusability.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Estimator untuk menjalankan tiga eksperimen dalam satu job, "
"manfaatkan nilai parameter untuk meningkatkan reusabilitas circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use batches and advanced options {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"
msgstr "Gunakan batch dan opsi lanjutan {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore the batch [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) and advanced "
"options to optimize circuit performance on QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jelajahi [mode eksekusi](/guides/execution-modes) batch dan opsi lanjutan "
"untuk mengoptimalkan performa circuit di QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Specify advanced runtime options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings) guide.\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- [Tentukan opsi runtime lanjutan](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Berlatih dengan primitif dengan mengerjakan [pelajaran Cost function](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) di IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
"- Pelajari cara transpile secara lokal di bagian [Transpile](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Coba panduan [Bandingkan pengaturan transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings).\n"
"- Baca [Migrasi ke primitif V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Pahami [Batas job](/guides/job-limits) saat mengirim job ke QPU IBM&reg;.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
